<section class="testimonials-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="testimonials-header">
            <h2 class="section-title">What our clients say</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Real feedback from real people we've worked with</p>
        </div>
        <div
            class="testimonials-wrapper">
            <!-- Client Tabs -->
            <div class="testimonial-tabs">
                <div class="tab-list" role="tablist">
                    <button class="tab-button active" data-tab="testimonial-1" role="tab" aria-selected="true">
                        <div class="client-info">
                            <img src="/images/testimonials/andrea_mccullough.png" alt="Michael Gough" class="client-avatar">
                            <div class="client-details">
                                <div class="client-name">A. McCullough</div>
                                <div class="client-title">Senior Teacher</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </button>
                    <button class="tab-button" data-tab="testimonial-2" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
                        <div class="client-info">
                            <img src="/images/testimonials/chris_suitor.png" alt="Bonnie Green" class="client-avatar">
                            <div class="client-details">
                                <div class="client-name">C. Suitor</div>
                                <div class="client-title">Retail</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </button>
                    <button class="tab-button" data-tab="testimonial-3" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
                        <div class="client-info">
                            <img src="/images/testimonials/jenny_lendrum.png" alt="Lana Byrd" class="client-avatar">
                            <div class="client-details">
                                <div class="client-name">J. Lendrum</div>
                                <div class="client-title">Educational Leader</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Testimonial Content -->
            <div class="testimonial-content">
                <div class="testimonial-panel active" id="testimonial-1" role="tabpanel">
                    <div class="quote-icon">❝</div>
                    <h3>Facilitated our ideas and thoughts to create a bespoke experience!</h3>
                    <p>Our school has benefitted hugely from the addition of a virtual tour. The engagement figures speak volumes for the
                        guidance and expertise of 360Spaces.</p>
                    <p>Our future pupils and parents are afforded an opportunity to look through the classrooms and see what our school
                        uniquely offers. Very easy to work with and facilitated our ideas and thoughts to create a bespoke experience.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial-panel" id="testimonial-2" role="tabpanel">
                    <div class="quote-icon">❝</div>
                    <h3>Big increase in public awareness!</h3>
                    <p>We’ve noticed a big increase in public awareness of who we are, what we offer and how to find out and that is
                        definitely helping sales.</p>
                    <p>Excellent work and value for money and we really appreciate his attention to detail.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial-panel" id="testimonial-3" role="tabpanel">
                    <div class="quote-icon">❝</div>
                    <h3>Absolutely delighted with the outcome!</h3>
                    <p>Thanks to 360Spaces we are able to welcome visitors to our school site 24/7. We loved building the virtual tour and
                        we are absolutely delighted with the outcome.</p>
                    <p>We are so proud to let visitors explore everything that Antrim Grammar School has to offer. We couldn’t have achieved
                        this without the professionalism and expertise of 360Spaces.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
        const tabButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-button');
        const testimonialPanels = document.querySelectorAll('.testimonial-panel');
        tabButtons.forEach(button => {
            button.addEventListener('click', function () {
                const targetTab = this.getAttribute('data-tab');
                // Remove active class from all buttons and panels
                tabButtons.forEach(btn => {
                    btn.classList.remove('active');
                    btn.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');
                });
                testimonialPanels.forEach(panel => {
                    panel.classList.remove('active');
                });
                // Add active class to clicked button and corresponding panel
                this.classList.add('active');
                this.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');
                document
                    .getElementById(targetTab)
                    .classList
                    .add('active');
            });
        });
    });
</script>